{"id":"n14974-1-7","stage":2,"title":"가렵다 · 痒","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14974-1-7-1","ko":"눈이 왜 그렇게 빨개?","zh":"眼睛怎么红成那样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈이","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"本句问眼睛为什么发红，눈 指身体部位眼睛，不是同音词雪。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"빨개?","meaning":"红","explanation":"빨갛다：红；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빨갛다","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71070","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨갛다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨개","audio":"/audio/23963ccdb9e6d40aa0c1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"眼睛","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6edc039e433d1613","term":"빨갛다","zh":"红","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3","entryId":"71070","definition":"如同鲜血或熟透的辣椒一样鲜明而浓艳地发红。","pronunciation":["빨ː가타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3854c00864b1c20be50.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14974-1-7-2","ko":"가려워서 손으로 비볐더니 그렇게 됐어.","zh":"因为痒，就用手揉了，所以才变成这样的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가려워서","meaning":"痒，发痒","explanation":"가렵다：痒，发痒；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가렵다","audio":"/audio/260e8a61746abc026a29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14974","senseId":"1","lemma":"가렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려워서","audio":"/audio/71df344cf931e9492751.mp3"}},{"text":"손으로","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손으로","audio":"/audio/76c1e0d34bb2dfa1de41.mp3"}},{"text":"비볐더니","meaning":"蹭，揉，搓","explanation":"비비다：蹭，揉，搓；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"비비다","audio":"/audio/1b28e62871e3ac43fd9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15702","senseId":"1","lemma":"비비다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비볐더니","audio":"/audio/f64d577aaa0f126ba38f.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어.","meaning":"变成那样了","explanation":"그렇게 됐어：变成了那样；这里的 되다 是表示状态变化的本动词。前面的 그렇게 是那样，不能只因字面以 게 结尾就认定为 -게 되다 辅助结构。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어","audio":"/audio/9b5be22a79f473c72762.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"260e8a61746abc02","term":"가렵다","zh":"痒，发痒","audio":"/audio/260e8a61746abc026a29.mp3","entryId":"14974","definition":"有想挠皮肤的感觉。","pronunciation":["가렵따"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"1b28e62871e3ac43","term":"비비다","zh":"蹭，揉，搓","audio":"/audio/1b28e62871e3ac43fd9a.mp3","entryId":"15702","definition":"将两个物体对着摩擦。","pronunciation":["비비다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变成某种情况或状态","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变成某种情况或状态","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6dc434aeb0689a665ad5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.605,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14974","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["眼睛怎么红成那样了？","因为痒，就用手揉了，所以才变成这样的。","我出去一会儿就回来。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["眼睛怎么红成那样了？","因为痒，就用手揉了，所以才变成这样的。","我出去一会儿就回来。"],"answer":1}]}
